"We use cookies to provide personalized content and ads. Google, as a third-"
"party vendor, uses cookies (such as the DART cookie) to serve ads based on "
"your visits to our and other sites on the internet."
msgstr ""
"Wir verwenden Cookies, um personalisierte Inhalte und Anzeigen "
"bereitzustellen. Google als Drittanbieter verwendet Cookies (wie das DART-"
